{{otheruses|the race|the creature|Orc (creature)}}

'''Orcs''' are aggressive [[humanoid]]s that raid, pillage, and battle other creatures. They have a hatred of [[elf|elves]] and [[dwarf|dwarves]] that goes back many generations.

Orcs are notable for being the only non-playable race that consists of a single species.
They are also the only non-playable race that can parent a playable race ([[half-orc]]s).

